### 登录获取token
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 获取科室列表
GET http://localhost:8081/api/admin/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 添加科室
POST http://localhost:8081/api/admin/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "测试科室",
  "introduction": "这是一个测试科室"
}

### 更新科室
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "更新后的科室名称",
  "introduction": "更新后的介绍"
}

### 删除科室
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/admin/departments/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 医生-问诊管理接口测试

### 获取问诊列表
GET http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

### 获取问诊详情
GET http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

### 开始问诊
PUT http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

### 完成问诊
PUT http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

{
    "diagnosis": "偏头痛",
    "treatment": "建议多休息，避免熬夜，保持良好作息"
}

### 开具处方
POST http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

{
    "diagnosis": "偏头痛",
    "medicines": [
        {
            "name": "布洛芬缓释胶囊",
            "usage": "口服",
            "dosage": "1次1粒",
            "frequency": "每日2次",
            "duration": "3天",
            "quantity": 6
        }
    ],
    "notes": "饭后服用，如有不适请及时就医"
}

### 查看处方
GET http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

### 修改处方
PUT http://localhost:8080/doctor/consultations/1/prescriptions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer_doctor1

{
    "diagnosis": "偏头痛",
    "medicines": [
        {
            "name": "布洛芬缓释胶囊",
            "usage": "口服",
            "dosage": "1次1粒",
            "frequency": "每日3次",
            "duration": "3天",
            "quantity": 9
        }
    ],
    "notes": "饭后服用，如有不适请及时就医。建议增加服用频次。"
} 